Tool response:
Tool: update_event_type_payment_settings
Description: Configure the specified event type to require payment via Stripe, set the price to $99, 
enable the 'WELCOME10' discount code for first-time users, and mark the event as paid-only 
so free slots are not shown until payment is confirmed.

Note: The database schema does not support storing a direct association between an Event Type
and a Discount Code. This endpoint updates the Event Type's pricing and visibility settings.
The `discount_code_id` returned in the response reflects the input parameter but is not persisted
in the `event_types` table due to schema limitations.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "event_type_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Event Type Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "price_cents": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Price Cents",
          "description": "Price in cents ($99 = 9900)"
        },
        "discount_code_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Discount Code Id",
          "description": "Internal ID of the discount code to apply (e.g., 'WELCOME10')"
        },
        "is_paid_only": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "title": "Is Paid Only",
          "description": "Whether the event should be paid-only"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event_type_id",
        "price_cents",
        "is_paid_only"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: find_discount_code_by_code
Description: Search for a discount code using its unique code value (e.g., 'WELCOME10') and return its internal ID and details.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Discount code value to search for",
          "title": "Code"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "code"
      ]
    }
